[{"op":"set","variable":30001,"value":1920},{"op":"set","variable":30002,"value":1080},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"连着好几天来小卖铺了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"对这家店变得很熟悉，仿佛自己也是熟客了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“大人们每天去居酒屋也是因为这样吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……哦。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“啊……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“………”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12141"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“好久不见。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在小卖铺里碰到了良一，天善，还有野美希。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知为何，良一和天善看上去不怎么开心……或者说是，阴沉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“很少见野美希来这里啊。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11766"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我是专门来等你的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“等我？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15044"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12147"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我带着疑问看向良一他们。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，他们却迅速扭过头撇开视线。"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“先买点什么吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11709"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“这是对店家的礼仪。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊，你说的对。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“刨冰怎么样？我请客。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“可以吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11750"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那我也不客气了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“真不好意思。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“不，我只请羽依里……”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“婆婆，请给我们四份刨冰。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“好好。400万日元。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“呜……啊…，那，给你，400日元。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“还差399万9千600日元呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老奶奶出来了的话，说明还没到苍打工的时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“草莓、蜜瓜、柠檬、蓝色夏威夷。你要什么味的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i12162"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“每种都来一份！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"小卖铺的老奶奶","text":"“味道都一样就是了。”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"坐在店门口的长椅上吃起了刨冰。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“还真是同一个味……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"都尝了几口后，确认了这一事实。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不一样的只是颜色而已。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12159"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“在婆婆告诉我前，我也以为味道会有区别。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“唔，我以前也这么想。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“感觉不经意间给我们上了一堂宝贵的人生课……”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“说起来鹰原。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“关于那个传闻。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“传闻？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11766"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你最近不是一直和苍在一起吗？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……确实是这样…怎么就成传闻了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11709"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我是听良一和天善说的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“昨天，你们在这张长椅上卿卿我我的。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“哦，卿卿我我吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12168"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看向良一和天善。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"两个人果然又迅速扭过头撇开视线。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“也不只是他们两个人。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11766"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“已经有很多人看见了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你在岛上的各种地方，和苍单独相处。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唔……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回想一下后发现，自己的确一直和苍在一起。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11755"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“鹰原，你到底是来这座岛做什么的？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“整理外婆的遗物。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“本来应该是这样的……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但镜子阿姨几乎不让我帮忙。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11701"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“我就直说了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“暑假结束后，你是要回城里去的吧？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……，应该是吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11780"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那你和苍这事……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“莫非，只是打算给她一个短暂的夏日之恋？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11763"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“要真是这样的话，暑假结束前我绝对会把你赶出这座岛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……原来如此。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"野美希是打算在自己的好朋友被渣男欺骗之前，防患于未然。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后，在她眼里我基本上就是渣男了。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11758"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“对你来说，苍是个怎样的存在？”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"从一开始，我就觉得她是个很有趣的女孩。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1017"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不管在哪里都能睡着，醒了后又非常热闹。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i31"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10396"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，正因如此和苍在一起才那么的开心。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10113"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就连原来学校里发生的那些不愉快都全置之脑后了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在一起是如此的舒适。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"也就是说――……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我……”"},{"op":"choice","variable":6001,"items":[{"text":"心里确实有苍","value":0,"condition":1},{"text":"说实话，已经忍不住了","value":1,"condition":1}]},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":191,"value":["==",["v",6001],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我心里确实有苍……真是真心话。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“和苍在一起的时候很开心。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“怎么说呢……我很喜欢她那表里如一的感觉。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“就算是夏天结束，就算是我离开了这座岛……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我也想再次见到苍。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“会想要回到这座岛。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15014"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11766"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12156"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“咻―♪”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"良一吹起了口哨。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"天善则不知为何露出了满足的微笑。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11771"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“原来如此……，鹰原你是喜欢上苍了呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉……这就是，喜欢吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“不是这样的吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“难道不是吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11753"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“是恋爱呢。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是吗……我喜欢上了苍吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"自己对这个词也没有什么实感。"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11724"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“呼～……恋爱，吗……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"噗通……"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“呜哇！野美希؟!怎么突然倒下了！”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12147"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“啊，害羞计量表爆表了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15038"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“主动跑过来管别人这种闲事，自己却没有半点抗性。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“真够麻烦的……”"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是大家开始吃起了刨冰，静候野美希的复活。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"goto","target":246},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说实话，我已经忍不住了……！”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11763"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……嚯……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“在哪都能睡也就算了，居然一点防备都没有？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“城市里是绝对不可能的啊？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“路边掉了个女孩子哦？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“居然都能当作没看到？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你们是怎么忍下来的？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“就算你这么说……”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i15017"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“岛上的同龄人就像是自家兄弟姐妹嘛。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“太佛系了吧，乡下！”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“城里的话――”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i196"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11787"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11787"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咔嚓！"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11790"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“够了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不知什么时候，Hydro Gladiator改的枪口已经抵在了我的脑门上。"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11793"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“你心术不正我已经完全理解了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i11790"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"野美希的食指，扣动了扳机。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"水枪的零距离射击。"},{"op":"clear","layer":2048},{"op":"clear","layer":1539},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i508"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":" “啊哇哇哇哇哇哇哇哇哇!؟” "},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我被喷射出的水流弄得无比狼狈。"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……脑子冷静下来……我也清醒过来了……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说真心话有点不好意思，所以才打算用玩笑话糊弄过去。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11755"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“嗯？也就是说？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说实话吧，我心里确实有苍。是男女间的那种。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11771"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“承认了吗。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15011"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11696"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12144"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“总之，鹰原你的心意我了解了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11693"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“再管下去就有些不识趣了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"野美希一脸满足……不如说是一脸开心地说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“说起来，今天苍还没有来吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12174"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“哦，今天是去诊所的日子吧？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11704"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉，诊所？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15044"},{"op":"text","speaker":"天善","text":"“野美希，有虫子。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11807"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“唔。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11804"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12220"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪咻――――――――!!"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“嘎吧叭叭叭叭叭叭叭!؟”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11789"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“多嘴的虫子就该消灭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i12146"},{"op":"text","speaker":"良一","text":"“……真…真滴很…对不起……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11766"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……那什么……”"},{"op":"if","truth":false,"target":272,"value":["==",["v",92],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……苍偶尔会去诊所这件事我多少知道一些……”"},{"op":"goto","target":273},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“苍去诊所这件事……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是我不方便打听的事情吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i15008"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11758"},{"op":"image","layer":513,"image":"i12150"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是的话，我就不多问了……”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11731"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“如果由苍直接告诉你，那就没问题了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11709"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“毕竟，这关系到她的个人隐私。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来，苍有什么不为我所知的秘密。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不对，野美希他们都知道的话，也许也算不上是什么秘密。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是，苍却没有和我说过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……要是去问苍的话，她会告诉我吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":257,"image":"i11771"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美希","text":"“那就要看你努力了。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……这样啊。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"之前，苍似乎不太想提及这件事。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但仔细想想的话，我又对苍有多少了解呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"除了在小卖铺打工，无论在哪都能睡着外，我一点都不了解她。"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"clear","layer":257},{"op":"clear","layer":513},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":1795,"image":"i18201"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i1140"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"前几天，晚上在山里看到的神奇光景。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看到她穿着巫女一样的衣服，提着灯笼在山里漫步的样子。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但我却不知道，她要那样做的理由……"},{"op":"image","layer":2050,"image":"i187"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1795},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i187"},{"op":"clear","layer":2050},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i8"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我比我自己想象的还要不了解苍……"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i444"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和野美希她们分开后，我漫无目的地在岛上溜达。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"反正直接回去也没事可干。"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i48"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看着大海，回想起与野美希他们的对话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“我……对苍……”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10630"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“对，就是嘭……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“唉？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10670"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回头一看，发现稻荷正坐在沙滩上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“我怎么了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10182"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而它的身后，苍正向这边走来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“你，你听到了？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10158"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“声音乘着海风，可以传很远哦。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是，是吗……”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10160"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“所以，我怎么了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……不……嘭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":7,"image":"i10632"},{"op":"text","speaker":"稻荷","text":"“嘭。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10290"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“你在说什么啊……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“没事，不用你知道。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这时机也太不巧了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"因为刚才和野美希他们的对话，现在莫名地感到不好意思。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"无论怎样都会意识到苍。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“那个……今天打工休息吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10322"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“嗯。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10298"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊，难道说你去过店里了？”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“嗯……刚刚去过。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10231"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“对不起。稍微有点杂事。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“……诊所？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10269"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唉……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“啊……因为良一说过这样的话。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10243"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“啊……原来如此……”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是身体哪里不舒服吗？”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10235"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“唔，稍微有点热感冒。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10224"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“没什么大不了的。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10194"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“不过，还是去配了点药。”"},{"op":"text","speaker":"羽依里","text":"“是因为你到处睡觉的关系才感冒的吧。”"},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10330"},{"op":"text","speaker":"苍","text":"“是啊，确实该注意一点了。”"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i236"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":1,"image":"i10323"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"总觉得在进行着毫无营养的对话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也好，苍也一样。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍对我隐瞒了什么很重要的事情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"而我也知道她瞒着我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过，现在我们谁也不去提及那件重要的事情。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"苍不希望我问。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"于是我也不问。"},{"op":"clear","layer":1},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i513"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没错，至少现在是这样――……"},{"op":"image","layer":0,"image":"i184"},{"op":"set","variable":6714,"value":0},{"op":"clear","layer":65281},{"op":"set","variable":23,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":19,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":20,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":21,"value":0},{"op":"set","variable":7120,"value":0},{"op":"return"},{"op":"end"}]